https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Ranged_Attack"}," (including all modifiers), you negate the attack against you.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Special: "]},"You can use this ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force Power"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Power"}," to negate an object being used as a projectile weapon with the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Move Light Object"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Move_Light_Object"}," application of the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Use the Force"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Use_the_Force","referenceId":"reference:74883d1dd46b87fe"}," skill, or the ",{"tag":"a","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Move Object"]}],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Move_Object","referenceId":"reference:1874cf1336711517"}," Force Power. In both cases, the DC for your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Use the Force"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Use_the_Force","referenceId":"reference:74883d1dd46b87fe"}," check is equal to the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Use the Force"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Use_the_Force","referenceId":"reference:74883d1dd46b87fe"}," check made by the opponent targeting you with the projectile. If you are successful, the object being used as a projectile weapon does not hit you, and deals no damage to you. Additionally, if the object was moved with the ",{"tag":"a","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Move Object"]}],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Move_Object","referenceId":"reference:1874cf1336711517"}," Force Power, the activator of that ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force Power"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Power"}," can no longer maintain the ",{"tag":"a","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Move Object"]}],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Move_Object","referenceId":"reference:1874cf1336711517"}," Force Power on that object.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["You can spend a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force Point"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Point"}," to use this ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force Power"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Power"}," to ",{"tag":"i","children":["Intercept"]}," some of the barrage of shots from a ranged weapon set on ",{"tag":"a","children":["Autofire"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Autofire"},". If you succeed on the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Use the Force"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Use_the_Force","referenceId":"reference:74883d1dd46b87fe"}," check, you take half damage if the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Autofire"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Autofire"}," attack hits, and no damage if the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Autofire"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Autofire"}," attack misses.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h4","children":["Starship Maneuver"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Starships of the Galaxy"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Starships_of_the_Galaxy"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["This maneuver allows a ship to fire thrusters and intercept a passing target, engaging in a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Dogfight"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Dogfight","referenceId":"reference:d47b1a4208bcd07f"},".\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Time:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Reaction"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Reaction"},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Targets:"]}," Self\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Make a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Pilot"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Pilot","referenceId":"reference:383e2d946278a872"}," check."]}," If an enemy ",{"tag":"a","children":["Starfighter"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Starfighter"}," or ",{"tag":"a","children":["Airspeeder"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Airspeeder"}," moves into a square up to 2 squares away from you, you my activate this maneuver to attempt to initiate a ",{"tag":"a","children":["D